connes-rigidity

This project is an independent experimental formalization of the mathematical
statement in Shuoxing Zhou, “ICC property(T) groups without
W*-superrigidity,” arXiv:2608.02327.

This distribution includes modified portions derived from the public
Apache-2.0 `openai/ten-proofs` snapshot
`94bc0feb6a9ff12c7d31d6de640a725c9d43d2b6` and its public organized
descendant `deancureton/ten-proofs` snapshot
`66af8383b1dbc53e21ceefc917a503b9bd88df51`.

The affected files, declaration blocks, source links, and modification classes
are recorded in `docs/PORT_MAP.md`. Each affected source file also carries a
prominent modification notice. General mathematical influence is recorded
separately and does not by itself assert a code transfer.

This project is independent and does not imply endorsement by or affiliation
with Shuoxing Zhou, OpenAI, or the maintainers of the organized snapshot.
